The  utility writes to the standard output three whitespace sepa‐
rated fields for each input file.  These fields  are  a  checksum
the  total number of octets in the file and the file name.  If no
file name is specified, the standard input is used  and  no  file
name is written.  The utility is identical to the utility, except
that  it defaults to using historic algorithm 1, as described be‐
low.  It is provided for compatibility only.  The  and  utilities
compute  cryptographic hash functions, and write to standard out‐
put the hexadecimal representation of the hash  of  their  input.
