2ˆ16 + (s % 2ˆ32) / 2ˆ16; cksum = (r % 2ˆ16) + r / 2ˆ16; Both al‐
gorithm 1 and 2 write to the standard output the same  fields  as
the  default  algorithm except that the size of the file in bytes
is replaced with the size of the file in  blocks.   For  historic
reasons, the block size is 1024 for algorithm 1 and 512 for algo‐
rithm  2.   Partial  blocks are rounded up.  Print warnings about
